    "description": "Complete Postman testing suite for EduHMS (Hospital Management System & EMR). Includes Auth with automated token capture, Clinical EMR, CDSS Drug Safety, LIS Laboratory, FEFO Pharmacy, Inpatient Wards, Billing, Accounting, HR, Call Centre, Meetings, Daily Reports, Staff Chat, OpenAI Copilot, and Arkesel SMS.",
